# No Strings Attached's Iruki-Waraki 260 (Progress, Option 1) against Puppetmaster Blues' available 782 (Progress,
# Operation Teatime completed, a level 75 Puppetmaster): equal kinds rotate by the last event played (task 8 review
# lesson: a lone reply at Iruki-Waraki shows no kind, its default event equals the quest events). Each trigger's finish
# begins one of the quests, so both are reset between the triggers.
lists AhtUrhganWhitegate/Iruki-Waraki/onTrigger
char zone=AhtUrhganWhitegate pos=101.329,-6,-29.042 job=PUP lvl=75
quest AhtUrhgan.OperationTeatime completed
charvar Quest[6][7]Option 1
login
trigger Iruki-Waraki                    # 260 (Progress) and 782 (Progress) rotate
finish
quest AhtUrhgan.NoStringsAttached available
quest AhtUrhgan.PuppetmasterBlues available
charvar Quest[6][7]Option 1
trigger Iruki-Waraki                    # 260 (Progress) and 782 (Progress) rotate
finish
quest AhtUrhgan.NoStringsAttached available
quest AhtUrhgan.PuppetmasterBlues available
charvar Quest[6][7]Option 1
trigger Iruki-Waraki                    # 260 (Progress) and 782 (Progress) rotate
finish
quest AhtUrhgan.NoStringsAttached available
quest AhtUrhgan.PuppetmasterBlues available
charvar Quest[6][7]Option 1
